rmettant une exonération d'impôt sur vos revenus locatifs.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"5 rue Labecq","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijg0MTBjMTU1NjgwYzNkMjUyY2Y0YTRkOGI2ZDMzNjhiMWZiYWE2OTgiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiMjJjZDhhMzQ4MWI0Zjc3NjZkOWYyN2ZiMTMxMjlkYyJ9?signature=a1e80fce8054807e03dbe1084412565b8062a4b4671de9b116662d791e4d9843","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjVkNTM3ZTAwOGFkMWE5ZGFkZTEwNmJhODhiMzBlYzI2MWMzMjgzNjAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxMjQ1N2Q0Y2ZlMTA2ZjFiNWY3ZDdiNzFkYTA2YTFkOSJ9?signature=a15c11ccb6a797dba7e7975c403bba407c0821372260152f00f77ddfca7a864e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImU2NTU2NDE1N2ZhM2JlMDZkYTdlOTFlMmUxY2VlMGJmNDY4NjA1NTUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI1YjJhMGMzOWZiN2NkMzAxZGIzMmFmYjhiMmIxOTMxMCJ9?signature=9da78dd87eb75b233c4e1e0e240e87b951d40a5a91f268bb9b5896a49e8fd91d","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjNmNDI2NWI5NTE1MWM1ZDk3MDIxY2FkNTdiYmRmNTEzYzZiZjFlMTQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiMGUyOWMzOWJhYTBiYjJiYmJjNjhlZGUzMTA2NmMwMCJ9?signature=714cd8455be92bd2daf8a42ab1298a1fdf9af4320f01d1519c9c70a2bf3781a7","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjVkNWM5NDZhY2UxYjkyOWI0ZGQyNDQzZjRkNjZhMWZkZjI3NTllYTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIxNTE3MWU3Mzg4ZWMwOTI1ZDY5Mz